{"id":13544,"artist":"Words & Music by Frank Loesser","title":"NEVER WILL I MARRY","lyrics_plain":"Any flimsy dimsy looking for true love\nbetter smile me no good dearie, good day.\nAny flimsy dimsy looking for true love\nbetter look her looking some other way,\nFor my kiss can be no evermore promise\nbut a fancy dancy fiddle and free.\nAny flimsy dimsy looking for true love\nbetter waste no time, no time on me.\nNever, never will I marry,\nnever, never will I wed.\nBorn to wander solitary,\nwide my world, narrow my bed.\nNever, never, never will I marry,\nborn to wander till I'm dead.\nNo burdens to bear, no conscience nor care,\nno mem'ries to mourn, no turning,\nFor I was born to wander solitary,\nwide my world, narrow my bed.\nNever, never, never will I marry,\nborn to wander till I'm dead.","lyrics_synced":"[00:03.76] Any flimsy dimsy looking for true love\n[00:07.09] better smile me no good dearie, good day.\n[00:10.41] Any flimsy dimsy looking for true love\n[00:13.75] better look her looking some other way,\n[00:17.09] For my kiss can be no evermore promise\n[00:20.42] but a fancy dancy fiddle and free.\n[00:23.76] Any flimsy dimsy looking for true love\n[00:27.09] better waste no time, no time on me.\n[00:38.78] Never, never will I marry,\n[00:49.80] never, never will I wed.\n[01:01.12] Born to wander solitary,\n[01:11.63] wide my world, narrow my bed.\n[01:22.64] Never, never, never will I marry,\n[01:34.43] born to wander till I'm dead.\n[01:49.19] No burdens to bear, no conscience nor care,\n[02:00.11] no mem'ries to mourn, no turning,\n[02:08.39] For I was born to wander solitary,\n[02:21.76] wide my world, narrow my bed.\n[02:33.00] Never, never, never will I marry,\n[02:44.57] born to wander till I'm dead.","lyrics_synced_enhanced":"[00:03.75] <00:03.75>An <00:03.95>y <00:04.16>flim <00:04.36>sy <00:04.57>dim <00:04.78>sy <00:04.99>look <00:05.20>ing <00:05.40>for <00:05.63>true <00:06.25>love\n[00:07.09] <00:07.09>bet <00:07.29>ter <00:07.50>smile <0